NAME

diskutil - Protected interactive disk inspection and management utility; storage authorization is required to enter

SYNOPSIS

    diskutil

DESCRIPTION

Protected interactive disk inspection and management utility; storage authorization is required to enter.

OPTIONS

    -h, --help — Show this help.

COMMANDS

    list — List whole disks or the selected disk's partitions.
    select <disk> — Select a whole disk.
    info — Show general or selected disk properties.
    format <target> <fat32|mgfs|exfat> — Format a disk or partition.
    label <target> <label> — Change a filesystem label.
    initialize gpt — Create a fresh GPT.
    create <size|rest> — Create a GPT partition.
    delete <partN> — Delete a GPT partition.
    back — Return to the disk list.
    help — Show commands available in the current state.
    exit — Leave diskutil.

NOTES

Destructive operations require storage authorization and exact typed confirmation.
Mounted, read-only, system-managed, or changed targets are rejected; whole-disk formatting requires no partitions.

